<h2 id="begin-with-the-universitys-record-responsibilities">Begin with the university’s record responsibilities</h2>

<p>The registrar governs authoritative academic awards and official transcript procedures. Academic teams approve assessment meaning; IT owns supported interfaces and access controls; career services reviews employability interpretation. A learner badge is not automatically a replacement for an official transcript request, and a transcript vendor may also offer badges and connected records.</p>

<p>For the institutional architecture, read <a href="/comprehensive-learner-record">Comprehensive Learner Record governance</a>. A connected record must retain achievement provenance and correction responsibilities, not merely collect attractive badge images.</p>

